            <ArticleTitle>Minimizing the pain of office procedures in children.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>415-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Office practitioners are often required to perform painful procedures on children. A wide variety of techniques that minimize the physical and psychologic trauma of the procedure are reviewed. Various methods of accomplishing some common procedures are evaluated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
